{"ID":"20240118151126-wfbuwus","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151126-wfbuwus","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151126-wfbuwus\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151126-n77qxsp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122131622-5hrlvn3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122131622-5hrlvn3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:203,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:221\u0026#125;","title":"195款冬花","type":"doc","updated":"20240201114557"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151126-n77qxsp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151126-n77qxsp","updated":"20240122131539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】一名颗东。一名虎须。一名菟奚。味辛，温，无毒。治咳逆上气，善喘，喉痹，诸惊痫，寒热邪气。生山谷及水傍，一名橐吾。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131542-2c79ufb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131542-2c79ufb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国陕西山河西北诸地，为山野多年生草，庭园亦可栽植，百草中惟此不顾冰雪，至冬即生芽而花，故名。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131545-h5w9mwv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131545-h5w9mwv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛甘，性温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131546-bgcqk76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131546-bgcqk76"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】款冬花为润肺祛痰止嗽要药，主治咳逆上气，肺痿肺痈，寒热邪气。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131547-c42krgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131547-c42krgj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】消渴，喘息呼吸。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131550-bwmah4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131550-bwmah4l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】疗肺气心促，急热劳咳，连连不绝，涕唾稠粘，肺痿肺痈吐脓血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131552-dpawo8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131552-dpawo8e"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】润心肺，益五脏，除烦消痰，洗肝明目，及中风等疾。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131554-o5mks7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131554-o5mks7q"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通钱半至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131555-rg5idhj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131555-rg5idhj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】咳逆消渴喘急，皆火炎气逆之病，款冬隆冬独秀，辛散而润，甘缓而和，故虚实寒热皆可用，无禁忌。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131557-naih22k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131557-naih22k"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】此药生于冬月冰雪之中，而花又在根下，乃坎中之阳象，故能引肺中阳气下行，而为利痰止咳之要药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122131541-r2aknoj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131541-r2aknoj"}},{"ID":"20240122131558-jit5bjw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131558-jit5bjw"}},{"ID":"20240122131558-sk26ka6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131558-sk26ka6","updated":"20240201113836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"195叫做，款冬花。当你处方的时候你写款冬花，写冬花，药房都看得懂。冬花呢长这样子，质非常的轻，止咳化痰的一个很重要的药。颜色带点粉红，很好看。在开处方的时候2钱。因为它的质很轻嘛，你开两钱就很多了。冬花。那它的味道是辛甘。辛味和甘味，辛甘为阳，阳性的药，能够化水，能够利水出来，【药性】是温性的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122131614-sy9ec3z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131614-sy9ec3z","updated":"20240122131615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】呢，款冬花是润肺去痰，止嗽的重要的药，会（治）肺痿和肺痈。因为它是温性的药，所以说你要治疗寒性的肺的问题最好。比如说病人寒咳，躺下去，人就咳，那嘴巴也不口渴，常常喉咙里面有水的声音，肺里面的有积水的声音，都可以使用它。"}]},{"ID":"20240122131617-geqo6zg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131617-geqo6zg","updated":"20240201114155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【甄权】呢，你看，肺的，肺气心促，咳嗽不绝啦，都可以使用。那一般来说，因为它药性是温度的，并不是说很强的，很热的药，是中，平温的，并不是很热的药，所以【禁忌】里面说，一般来说冬花，款冬花为什么叫冬花，冬天的时候它开花。它的药性是辛散，润，能够润燥，甘缓而和，所以有的时候你看到咳嗽，不清楚虚实寒热，你都用冬花都没有关系。没有那么强烈的，说一定要寒证的才使用，热证也可以使用。它没有什么大的禁忌。"}]},{"ID":"20240122131622-5hrlvn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122131622-5hrlvn3","updated":"20240201114557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【唐容川】，他说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"药生于冬月冰雪中，花又在根的下面，这花开不在上面，在下面的。是坎中阳，所以能引肺的气，阳气下行，是利痰止咳的药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"引肺气下行的时候，前面还有个磁石。金石类的药里面呢，就是磁石，可以引肺气下行。所以我们治疗气喘，咳嗽，呼吸短气的时候，肾脏病，我们都可以使用磁石。那这里是植物性的药，花类的药，冬花很好用。那临证上面，处方里面，张仲景使用冬花，紫苑啊，经方里面会看到这味药。所以诸位要记得，引肺气下行的，能够止咳，又能够定喘，冬花非常好用。"}]}]}